      "source": "Add a <a href=\"RandomValuePropertySource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.env\"><code>RandomValuePropertySource</code></a> to the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a>.",
      "translation": "向给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a> 添加一个 <a href=\"RandomValuePropertySource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.env\"><code>RandomValuePropertySource</code></a>。",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>environment</code> - the environment to add the random property source to",
      "translation": "<code>environment</code> - 要添加随机属性源的运行环境",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Name of the random <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/PropertySource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>PropertySource</code></a>.",
      "translation": "随机 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/PropertySource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>PropertySource</code></a> 的名称。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>OPEN value (,max) CLOSE</code> where the <code>OPEN,CLOSE</code> are any character and\n<code>value,max</code> are integers. If <code>max</code> is not provided, then 0 is used as the\nlower bound and <code>value</code> is the upper bound. If <code>max</code> is provided then\n<code>value</code> is the minimum value and <code>max</code> is the maximum (exclusive).",
      "translation": "`OPEN value (,max) CLOSE`，其中 <code>OPEN,CLOSE</code> 为任意字符，而 <code>value,max</code> 为整数。如果未提供 <code>max</code>，则使用 0 作为下界，<code>value</code> 作为上界。如果提供了 <code>max</code>，则 <code>value</code> 为最小值，<code>max</code> 为最大值（不包含）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/PropertySource.html#getProperty(java.lang.String)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\">getProperty</a></code> in class <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/PropertySource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\">PropertySource</a>&lt;<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Random.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\">Random</a>&gt;</code>",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/PropertySource.html#getProperty(java.lang.String)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\">getProperty</a></code> 方法在类 <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/PropertySource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\">PropertySource</a>&lt;<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Random.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\">Random</a>&gt;</code> 中。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "When \"int\", a random <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Integer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Integer</code></a> value, restricted by an optionally\nspecified range.",
      "translation": "当指定为 \"int\" 时，表示一个由可选指定的范围限制的随机 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Integer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Integer</code></a> 值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "When \"long\", a random <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Long.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Long</code></a> value, restricted by an optionally\nspecified range.",
      "translation": "当指定为 \"long\" 时，生成一个随机 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Long.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Long</code></a> 值，该值受可选指定的范围限制。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "When \"uuid\", a random <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/UUID.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>UUID</code></a> value.",
      "translation": "当\"uuid\"是一个随机的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/UUID.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>UUID</code></a> 值。",
      "count": 2
    },
